  <goal>Outbound message bodies include `activeContext` matching the focused tab; "summarize this" with an email focused resolves to that email.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>FR-A2 — the outbound-body seam is `onDecorateOutboundBody` → `handleDecorateOutboundBodyWithRevise` wraps the base `handleDecorateOutboundBody` at ConversationPane.tsx:1955-2090; the prop is wired at :2800. The base body is {message, documentId, attachments}.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/src/components/conversation/ConversationPane.tsx (handleDecorateOutboundBodyWithRevise :1955-2090)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">MUST use the existing onDecorateOutboundBody seam — MUST NOT fork SprkChat.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015">Active tab emits a COMPACT shape only (compact-ambient) — do NOT dump full content.</constraint>
  </constraints>
