      <steps>Focus a tab, send a message, and inspect the outbound body; verify `activeContext` matches the focused tab and is a bounded compact shape. Include an ADR-021 dark-mode no-regression check.</steps>
      <expected>Outbound body includes activeContext matching the focused tab; compact shape bounded; no dark-mode regressions.</expected>
    </test>
