  <justification>
    <existing>handleDecorateOutboundBodyWithRevise wraps the base decorator at :1955; body is {message, documentId, attachments}.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — additive field on the existing decorate seam.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>The server cannot know which tab is focused; active-tab resolution stays wrong.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>
